ator of flame alchemy  there are two homunculi other than  father that can perform alchemy  interestingly they're both the reverse  roles to king bradley as he played those  homunculi in the opposite version of  fullmetal alchemist these are pride and  wrath  2003's wrath who has edward's arm and  leg is able to use alchemy he uses this  to supplement his monkey liability which  allows him to fuse his body with  different substances  pride in brotherhood gains the abilities  of the people and objects that he  consumes this includes kimberley and the  goldtooth doctor and finally we have a  few minor alchemists that we meet along  the way often in kind of bad guy of the  week sort of roles  majal wanted to create perfect living  dolls based on his deceased love and  uses alchemy to create incomplete living  mannequins hoping that ed will teach him  how he created al's metal body majal  goes a little bit crazy along the way  especially when he learns that his love  was never really dead to begin with and  is now an old woman lujon was an  alchemic doctor that reminds 2003's lust  of her creator and she gives him a  philosopher's stone to heal his fiance  from fossil's disease however lujan ends  up falling in love with lust and  ultimately she kills him for this and  the last alchemist we have to talk about  is clara who's known as a phantom thief  she mainly uses alchemy to manipulate a  deck of cards for example turning them  into a katana and that's it every  relevant alchemist in the series as well  as the irrelevant ones as always a  question for you all which alchemist was  your favorite and if you were an  alchemist what would you specialize in i  think my favorite in the series is  probably mustang it's kind of hard to  argue with him just being insanely cool  but if i had to choose a type of alchemy  for myself i might have to choose  something similar to isaac mcdougall as  i've always had a bit of a soft spot for  water and ice based abilities if you  guys 